  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">East African Association of Anti-corruption       Authorities (EAAACA)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">East African Association of Anti-corruption       Authorities (EAAACA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmet har tre m&#xe5;l n&#xe4;mligen: (i) Att st&#xe4;rka kapaciteten hos       EAAACA medlemmar f&#xf6;r att bek&#xe4;mpa och f&#xf6;rebygga korruption              (ii) F&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra kommunikation, information och kunskapsutbyte om strategier f&#xf6;r att bek&#xe4;mpa korruptionen bland medlemsl&#xe4;nderna      myndigheter, regeringar, media och andra intressenter (III) Att       st&#xe4;rka kapaciteten hos EAAACA Sekretariatet f&#xf6;r effektiv samordning</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme has three objectives namely: (i)To strengthen the       capacities of EAAACA members to combat and prevent corruption          (ii)To improve communication, information and knowledge exchange on  strategies for combating corruption among member authorities,         governments, media and other stakeholders (iii)To strengthen the      capacity of EAAACA Secretariat for effective coordination</narrative>
  </description>
